r {overflow-x: auto;border: 1px solid #1f1f1f}\ntable.comparison-table {width: 100%;border-collapse: collapse;text-align: left;font-size: 0.9rem}\ntable.comparison-table th, \ntable.comparison-table td {padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;border-bottom: 1px solid #1f1f1f}\ntable.comparison-table th {background: #121212;color: #ffffff;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-transform: uppercase;font-size: 0.8rem}\ntable.comparison-table tr:last-child td {border-bottom: none}\ntable.comparison-table td.highlight {color: #00ff66;font-weight: 600}\n.faq-section {margin-bottom: 6rem}\n.faq-grid {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;gap: 3rem}\n.faq-item {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 0.75rem}\n.faq-item h3 {color: #ffffff;font-size: 1.05rem;font-weight: 600}\n.faq-item p {color: #888;font-size: 0.9rem}\nfooter {border-top: 1px solid #1f1f1f;padding: 3rem;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;font-size: 0.8rem;color: #666}\n@media(max-width: 1024px) {\n  .hero-section {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 2rem}\n  .hero-col:nth-child(2) {border-left: none;border-right: none;padding: 0}\n  .specs-grid, .faq-grid {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 2rem}\n  header.top-bar {padding: 1rem 1.5rem}\n  main {padding: 7rem 1.5rem 3rem 1.5rem}\n}\n</style><header class=\"top-bar\">\n  <div class=\"logo\">嗨皮云 // SYSTEMS</div>\n  <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n    <a href=\"#overview\">系统概览</a>\n    <a href=\"#architecture\">架构说明</a>\n    <a href=\"#plans\">服务层级</a>\n    <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <div id=\"overview\"></div>\n  <section class=\"hero-section\">\n    <div class=\"hero-col\">\n      <div>\n        <h1>嗨皮云</h1>\n        <p class=\"hero-quote\">面向专业场景的高性能网络连接与数据传输架构控制台。</p>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">版本 3.5.70<br>状态：全节点正常运行</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-col\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>设计理念</h2>\n        <p>系统通过精简的路由策略与多端分配模型，确保在复杂网络环境下的数据吞吐效率。所有传输层规则均经过严格校验，提供确定性的响应表现。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        协议层：TCP/UDP Multiplexing<br>加密标准：AES-256-GCM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-col\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>核心指标</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>99.9%</strong> 系统可用性保障</li>\n          <li><strong>0.2ms</strong> 核心路由底层延迟</li>\n          <li><strong>20+</strong> 全球骨干网接入点</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        数据更新于实时监控终端\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div id=\"architecture\"></div>\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">系统架构与技术说明</h2>\n  <section class=\"specs-grid\">\n    <div class=\"spec-card\">\n      <h3>01 / 传输控制</h3>\n      <p>采用自定义拥塞控制算法，动态调整数据包发送窗口，降低高延迟环境下的丢包率，维持链路稳定性。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"spec-card\">\n      <h3>02 / 节点调度</h3>\n      <p>智能化健康检查探针实时扫描骨干网状态，自动将连接请求导向低负载、高吞吐的传输节点。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"spec-card\">\n      <h3>03 / 多端协同</h3>\n      <p>支持多终端并发鉴权，授权状态实时同步，允许在不同设备间无缝切换工作流与网络环境。</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div id=\"plans\"></div>\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">服务层级与配置对比</h2>\n  <section class=\"plans-section\">\n    <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n      <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>服务层级</th>\n            <th>每月流量</th>\n            <th>设备并发</th>\n            <th>核心特性</th>\n            <th>月付价格</th>\n            <th>年付优惠</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>基础版</strong></td>\n            <td>100GB 极速流量</td>\n            <td>3 台设备同时在线</td>\n            <td>解锁基础流媒体 / 普通线路节点池</td>\n            <td>¥15/月</td>\n            <td class=\"highlight\">¥150/年</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>旗舰版</strong></td>\n            <td>300GB 极速流量</td>\n            <td>5 台设备同时在线</td>\n            <td>全节点原生解锁 / IPLC 专线游戏加速 / 优先工单</td>\n            <td>¥35/月</td>\n            <td class=\"highlight\">¥350/年</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>团队版</strong></td>\n            <td>1000GB 极速流量</td>\n            <td>20 台设备同时在线</td>\n            <td>VIP 专属高带宽 / 企业定制路由 / 专属客户经理</td>\n            <td>¥85/月</td>\n            <td class=\"highlight\">¥850/年</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div id=\"faq\"></div>\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见问题技术解答</h2>\n  <section class=\"faq-section\">\n    <div class=\"faq-grid\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h3>如何开始配置客户端连接？</h3>\n        <p>在用户控制台获取专属订阅链接，将其导入至兼容的客户端软件中，即可自动同步节点列表与路由规则。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h3>流量重置周期是如何计算的？</h3>\n        <p>所有账户的可用流量额度均在每月自然日的第一天（00:00 UTC+8）自动重置为对应层级的初始数值。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h3>IPLC 专线与普通线路有何区别？</h3>\n        <p>IPLC 专线不经过公共互联网传输，采用内网直连架构，可显著降低延迟并消除晚高峰期间的波动现象。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h3>支持哪些类型的支付结算方式？</h3>\n        <p>系统支持主流的在线支付结算。年付方案可直接在后台生成并应用相应折扣，无需额外的优惠代码。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div>嗨皮云 技术文档与服务说明</div>\n  <div>© 2026 HIPYUN SYSTEMS. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</div>\n</footer>",
